  "description": "[Original Webtoon](https://page.kakao.com/content/61167054)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/154939)\n\nHe was cursed to die if he did not find true love.  A Sowon grew up under loving (?) parents who changed her lover after saying “I love you” every day.  I learned too quickly that love is useless and boring.  “Why is everyone doing this?”  “If you don’t find true love before the first rainy season comes, I will take the price of your soul for belittling the dragon.”  The dragon's curse began to fall on Han So-won, who was living a dry and peaceful life!!  Will it be possible to escape this damn curse and find true love before the rainy season comes?",
